    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d914">

                <pb facs="0637" n="565" sameAs="frus:frus1865p4/pg565"/>

                <head>A. Niderast and P. Benl</head>
                <note rend="inline" rendition="#center" type="source">[Translation.]</note>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Brunnen</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-06">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 6, 1865</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">To the Bund:</hi>
                </p>
                <p>As the pious hearts of Switzerland have always throbbed in sympathy with the good
                    people of America, now grieving for their noble President Lincoln, we cordially
                    join in the address of condolence prepared for them by the people of the Swiss
                    Confederation.</p>
                <p>We hope you will convey this expression to its proper address.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>A. NIDERAST.</item>
                            <item>P. BENL.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
